OL,3,AUS murderer Christa Pike discharged
OL,4,Afrom hospital 10 days after failed
OL,5,Aexecution
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS death row inmate Christa Pike has
OL,8,Fbeen discharged from hospital following
OL,9,Fher botched execution at the end of
OL,10,Flast month, her lawyers have said.
OL,12,FThe 50-year-old murderer has been
OL,13,Freturned to the prison where she has
OL,14,Fspent the last 30 years, according to a
OL,15,Fstatement from her lawyers on Saturday.
OL,17,FShe is continuing to receive medical
OL,18,Fcare at the prison.
OL,20,FPike survived two lethal injections of
OL,21,Fthe drug pentobarbital on 30 September,
OL,22,Fwhich left her in a critical condition.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
